@startuml
!include style.iuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceGroupFontSize 18
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 18
skinparam noteFontSize 18
hide footbox
skinparam padding 2
skinparam sequenceMessagePadding 2
title SQ1 - FAIL, khắc phục và kiểm tra lại
actor MANAGER as M
actor TECHNICIAN as T
participant "API\nChecklist / Issue" as A
database PostgreSQL as D
M -> A : FAIL: version Item, mô tả, assignee
A -> D : Kiểm tra version; transaction\nItem FAIL + Issue OPEN
T -> A : Start (version Issue)
A -> D : Kiểm tra ownership / version;\nOPEN -> IN_PROGRESS
T -> A : Resolve\n(version Issue, resolutionNote)
A -> D : IN_PROGRESS -> RESOLVED;\nItem vẫn FAIL (transaction)
M -> A : Recheck (PASS / FAIL, note,\nversion Issue + version Item)
group Transaction recheck
  A -> D : Khóa; đúng hai version, RESOLVED
  alt PASS
    A -> D : Issue CLOSED + Item PASS
  else FAIL: bắt buộc reason
    A -> D : Issue OPEN + Item FAIL
  end
  D --> A : Commit; tăng cả hai version
end
A --> M : Kết quả mới
legend bottom
  Mỗi action cần quyền; TECHNICIAN phải là assignee hiện hành.
  Các action trả version mới; lỗi: rollback, không tiếp tục luồng.
  CLOSED giữ lịch sử; FAIL về sau tạo Issue mới.
endlegend
@enduml
